{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073290/extras/Screen_Recording_2024-07-09_at_7.50.42\u202fAM.gif?t=1723746543\" /><br><i>Frog World</i> was inspired by classic platformers like <i>Super Mario World</i> but with a <i>Spider-Man</i> swinging twist. This game really makes you feel like a cute little frog by expressing yourself through movement.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073290/extras/Screen_Recording_2024-07-10_at_8.01.46\u202fAM.gif?t=1723746543\" /><br>Immerse yourself in a calming world and collect fireflies along the way.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073290/extras/Screen_Recording_2024-07-09_at_8.08.24\u202fAM.gif?t=1723746543\" /><br>Make friends! Each new friend might have something worthwhile to help you on your adventure.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073290/extras/Screen_Recording_2024-07-09_at_8.23.13\u202fAM.gif?t=1723746543\" /><br>Unlock new movement options to help reach different areas of the world and complete new quests!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073290/extras/Screen_Recording_2024-07-09_at_8.17.03\u202fAM.gif?t=1723746543\" /><br>Navigate a small and interconnected world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>You play as an adorable frog</strong><br></li><li><strong>Swing</strong> and <strong>jump</strong> over platforming challenges!<br></li><li><strong>Collect</strong> fireflies to unlock new <strong>abilities</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Talk</strong> to the Swamp dwellers and <strong>immerse</strong> yourself in the world!</li></ul><br>Note from the Developer:<br><br>Thank you so much for checking out <i>Frog World</i>! This is my firs